       15   field vat-acc        as decimal
       16   field vat-cur        as decimal
       17   field vat-doc        as decimal
       18   field transport-acc  as decimal
       19   field transport-cur  as decimal
       20   field transport-doc  as decimal
       21   field other-acc      as decimal
       22   field other-cur      as decimal
       23   field other-doc      as decimal
       24   field road-tax-acc   as decimal
       25   field road-tax-cur   as decimal
       26   field road-tax-doc   as decimal
