       33   .
       34   define temp-table temp-goods no-undo
       35   field gds-code       as integer
       36   field sum-crit       as decimal
       37   field crit-pr        as decimal
       38   field crit           as char
       39   field kol-period     as int
       40   field average-qnty   as decimal
       41   field sigma          as decimal
       42   field K_V            as decimal
       43   field qnty           as decimal
       44   field price-crc      as decimal
       45   field reserve-day    as integer
       46   field sum-acc        as decimal
       47   field sum-cur        as decimal
       48   field sum-doc        as decimal
       49   field vat-acc        as decimal
       50   field vat-cur        as decimal
       51   field vat-doc        as decimal
       52   field transport-acc  as decimal
       53   field transport-cur  as decimal
       54   field transport-doc  as decimal
       55   field other-acc      as decimal
       56   field other-cur      as decimal
       57   field other-doc      as decimal
       58   field road-tax-acc   as decimal
       59   field road-tax-cur   as decimal
       60   field road-tax-doc   as decimal
